//Terminus2k28 story.// 

//CHAPTER TITLES.//  

Chapter one: Yesterday thaws alive for freedom. 
Chapter two: Tomorrow's monsters are here. 
Chapter three: My heart beats for you now. 

//ARCADE MODE LOAD SCREEN TEXT.// 

Frozen in 1990 and now awake in 2028, our hero - Sgt. Valentine Wakefield - must escape Cryosleep before a system collapse. 

//SURVIVOR MODE LOAD SCREEN TEXT.//  

Sgt. Valentine Wakefield beats back against this new hellscape spawning creatures that need him dead. 
Deep in the distant sky, a crackle of hope splits through. 

//FIRST PERSON MODE LOAD SCREEN TEXT.// 

Sgt. Valentine Wakefield battles to deliver his heart for a transplant to his ailing scientist son Dr. Mike Wakefield. 

//ENDING STORY TEXT.//  

With his newly transplanted father's heart, Dr. Mike Wakefield lives and is able to complete his pivotal work
dismantling the A.I. overlord responsible for Earth's dystopia by infecting it with a techno-virus. 
